@@ -0,0 +1,15 @@
+## Context
+
+`src/index.ts` already has `isObject`, `cloneJson` and `setMember` (safe own-property assignment, handles `__proto__`).
+
+## Goals / Non-Goals
+
+**Goals:** a faithful, recursive RFC 7386 implementation that does not mutate inputs.
+**Non-Goals:** generating merge patches (diffing); validating that inputs are JSON.
+
+## Decisions
+
+- Recursive function building a fresh object: copy target members (cloned), then for each patch key delete on `null`, else set to the recursive merge. Uses `cloneJson`/`setMember`/`Object.hasOwn` so nothing is shared and `__proto__` is safe.
+- Non-object patch returns `cloneJson(patch)`; non-object target is treated as `{}`.
+- Only own enumerable members of the patch are considered (`Object.keys`).
+- No custom error type: the algorithm is total over JSON values.
