@@ -0,0 +1,20 @@
+## Why
+
+Some clients send partial updates in the simpler JSON Merge Patch format (RFC 7386). The toolkit only supports RFC 6902 JSON Patch today.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add `applyMergePatch(target, patch)`, exported from `src/index.ts`, implementing RFC 7386 `MergePatch`.
+- Inputs are never mutated and the result shares no mutable structure with them.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `json-merge-patch`: applying an RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch to a JSON document.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- `src/index.ts`: new exported function, reusing the existing JSON helpers.
+- `test/`: new merge patch tests.
